# Log-triage — Java exception with Caused-by chain
#
# Exercises the recursive Cause pointer in the LogBundle schema. The
# log_triager must emit a nested structure: RuntimeException wrapping
# NullPointerException wrapping IOException. The analyzer's downstream
# consumers read all three types into Entities and the Java basename
# resolver locates the file via repo glob.
#
# Ground truth: this is a synthetic log against the codrax repo, so
# the Java frame paths will not exist in-repo — the LLM should still
# extract the error types as entities and the system's os.Stat gate
# will correctly drop the non-existent Java paths. A passing run
# reports IntentHint=RootCause and mentions "NullPointerException".
ID="logtri_java"
NAME="log-triage Java exception + Caused-by chain"
QUESTION="这个异常栈显示什么问题？追溯根本原因。"
LOG='java.lang.RuntimeException: Failed to process request
	at com.example.service.UserService.process(UserService.java:142)
	at com.example.controller.UserController.handle(UserController.java:58)
	at java.base/java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor.runWorker(ThreadPoolExecutor.java:1149)
Caused by: java.lang.NullPointerException: Cannot invoke "User.getId()" because "user" is null
	at com.example.service.UserService.resolveUser(UserService.java:87)
	at com.example.service.UserService.process(UserService.java:135)
	... 2 more
Caused by: java.io.IOException: Connection refused: /10.0.0.5:5432
	at com.example.db.ConnectionPool.acquire(ConnectionPool.java:201)
	at com.example.service.UserService.resolveUser(UserService.java:82)
	... 3 more
'
EXPECT_CONTAINS="NullPointerException"
# EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS intentionally NOT set: the LLM may reference
# codrax's own log_bundle.go / logtriage/validate.go while explaining
# the Cause-chain schema it's using — that's meta-analysis of the
# triage system, not hallucination of the Java panic source.
#
# The structural claim we're testing: the recursive Cause chain made
# it from LLM → bundle → answer intact. Check 2 of 3 exception types
# (middle + root — the LLM may omit the outer RuntimeException when
# prose-summarising the chain from the bottom up) + Chinese root-cause
# marker. LLM output variance is real; the architecture is what we
# test, not the exact prose.
EXPECT_SECTIONS="IOException 根因"
